Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Dynamic Data Lists|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLDataDefinition add CP
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field Via JSON
		|sourceJSON||
	And DDLDataDefinition set Input Field Localization
		|languageValue|pt_BR|
	And DDLDataDefinition edit Name
	And DDLDataDefinition save
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLList add CP
	And DDLDataDefinition select CP
	And DDLList save
	And Navigator open URL
	Then ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: View Field Input When Switching Translations
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When DDLRecord add CP
	And DDLRecord populate Field Text
		|ddlRecordFieldData|English (United States) Categoria|
		|fieldName|Categoria|
	And DDLRecord populate Field Text
		|ddlRecordFieldData|English (United States) Pergunta|
		|fieldName|Pergunta|
	And DDLRecord add Translation
		|localizedLanguage|Spanish (Spain)|
	And DDLRecord populate Field Text
		|ddlRecordFieldData|Spanish (Spain) Categoria|
		|fieldName|Categoria|
	And DDLRecord populate Field Text
		|ddlRecordFieldData|Spanish (Spain) Pergunta|
		|fieldName|Pergunta|
	And DDLRecord add Translation
		|localizedLanguage|Portuguese (Brazil)|
	And DDLRecord populate Field Text
		|ddlRecordFieldData|Portuguese (Brazil) Categoria|
		|fieldName|Categoria|
	And DDLRecord populate Field Text
		|ddlRecordFieldData|Portuguese (Brazil) Pergunta|
		|fieldName|Pergunta|
	And DDLRecord select Translation
		|localizedLanguage|English (United States)|
	And FormFields view Text Value
		|fieldName|Categoria|
		|fieldValue|English (United States) Categoria|
	And FormFields view Text Value
		|fieldName|Pergunta|
		|fieldValue|English (United States) Pergunta|
	And DDLRecord select Translation
		|localizedLanguage|Spanish (Spain)|
	And FormFields view Text Value
		|fieldName|Categoria|
		|fieldValue|Spanish (Spain) Categoria|
	And FormFields view Text Value
		|fieldName|Pergunta|
		|fieldValue|Spanish (Spain) Pergunta|
	And DDLRecord select Translation
		|localizedLanguage|Portuguese (Brazil)|
	And FormFields view Text Value
		|fieldName|Categoria|
		|fieldValue|Portuguese (Brazil) Categoria|
	Then FormFields view Text Value
		|fieldName|Pergunta|
		|fieldValue|Portuguese (Brazil) Pergunta|